ame\">FFT</span>.<span class=\"name\">mulPow2At</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">A </span><span class=\"fn\">L</span> : <a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">[<span class=\"fn\">LA</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./MPN/LimbArray.html#MPN.LimbArray\">LimbArray</a> <span class=\"fn\">A</span> <span class=\"fn\">L</span></span>]</span></span> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">[<span class=\"fn\">R</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./MPN/WordArray.html#MPN.WordArray\">WordArray</a> <span class=\"fn\">A</span> <span class=\"fn\">L</span></span>]</span></span> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">[<span class=\"fn\">F</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./MPN/WordArray.html#MPN.WordFolds\">WordFolds</a> <span class=\"fn\">A</span> <span class=\"fn\">L</span></span>]</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">arr</span> : <span class=\"fn\">A</span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">n </span><span class=\"fn\">d </span><span class=\"fn\">t </span><span class=\"fn\">e</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#USize\">USize</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">hd</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./MPN/FFT/Fermat.html#MPN.FFT.Win\">Win</a> <span class=\"fn\">arr</span> <span class=\"fn\">n</span> <span class=\"fn\">d</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">ht</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./MPN/FFT/Fermat.html#MPN.FFT.Win\">Win</a> <span class=\"fn\">arr</span> <span class=\"fn\">n</span> <span class=\"fn\">t</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">he</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">e</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Data/UInt/BasicAux.html#USize.toNat\">toNat</a></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#LT.lt\">&lt;</a> <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./MPN/LimbArray.html#MPN.LimbArray.w\">LimbArray.w</a> <span class=\"fn\">A</span></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HMul.hMul\">*</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">n</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Data/UInt/BasicAux.html#USize.toNat\">toNat</a></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\">A</span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Writes `t 2ᵉ % F` into the window at `d`, for a residue `t` in the window at `t`, disjoint from\nit, and `e < w n`. With `e = w q + b`, the limbs of `t` above `n - q` wrap around negated, since\n`2^(w n) ≡ -1`: they are subtracted from zero into the low `q` limbs, the others are copied above\nthem less the borrow and the top limb of `t`, and `1` is added when that borrows. The shift by\n`b` bits, when `b ≠ 0`, follows in place, then a reduction.","docLink":"./MPN/FFT/Fermat.html#MPN.FFT.mulPow2At","kind":"def","line":708,"name":"MPN.FFT.mulPow2At","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-mpn/blob/862f63d87fc6e56d648eb33296f1cf7ff688fd89/MPN/FFT/Fermat.lean#L708-L745"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">theorem</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./MPN/FFT/Fermat.html#MPN.FFT.addSubModAt_spec\"><span class=\"name\">MPN</span>.<span class=\"name\">FFT</span>.<span class=\"name\">addSubModAt_spec</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">A </span><span class=\"fn\">L</span> : <a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">[<span class=\"fn\">LA</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./MPN/LimbArray.html#MPN.LimbArray\">LimbArray</a> <span class=\"fn\">A</span> <span class=\"fn\