` into the window at `d` in one pass\nover the windows at `x` and `y` (`fold2x2Then`), for residues `x` and `y`: the sum and the\ndifference of a butterfly. The windows at `s` and `d` are disjoint, and each one starts at or\nbelow each window read, or above its end, as with `addModAt` and `subModAt`.","docLink":"./MPN/FFT/Fermat.html#MPN.FFT.addSubModAt","kind":"def","line":637,"name":"MPN.FFT.addSubModAt","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-mpn/blob/862f63d87fc6e56d648eb33296f1cf7ff688fd89/MPN/FFT/Fermat.lean#L637-L650"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">theorem</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./MPN/FFT/Fermat.html#MPN.FFT.subModAt_spec\"><span class=\"name\">MPN</span>.<span class=\"name\">FFT</span>.<span class=\"name\">subModAt_spec</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">A </span><span class=\"fn\">L</span> : <a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">[<span class=\"fn\">LA</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./MPN/LimbArray.html#MPN.LimbArray\">LimbArray</a> <span class=\"fn\">A</span> <span class=\"fn\">L</span></span>]</span></span> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">[<span class=\"fn\">R</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./MPN/WordArray.html#MPN.WordArray\">WordArray</a> <span class=\"fn\">A</span> <span class=\"fn\">L</span></span>]</span></span> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">[<span class=\"fn\">F</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./MPN/WordArray.html#MPN.WordFolds\">WordFolds</a> <span class=\"fn\">A</span> <span class=\"fn\">L</span></span>]</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">arr</span> : <span class=\"fn\">A</span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"